  "hard_rules": [
    "generation-local entities remain distinct and immutable and lineage is an explicit overlay relation",
    "user project Blizzard UI source and Reference universes never form lineage with one another",
    "same name path signature body fingerprint graph neighborhood or search rank is Candidate evidence only",
    "a unique candidate is not automatically Proven or Derived",
    "candidate generation is bounded by reviewed blocking and never unrestricted all-pairs",
    "one-to-many many-to-one and ambiguity are preserved and never forced into a bijection",
    "copy move split merge rename replacement deprecation removal introduction and migration remain distinct",
    "search_lineage_candidate is capped at Candidate regardless of E4-A authority band",
    "review cannot exceed the minimum relation input reviewer coverage and conflict proof ceiling",
    "rejected deferred superseded and conflicting proposals remain auditable",
    "Removed and Introduced require closed complete exact negative-authority coverage",
    "replacement is not inferred from lineage similarity unmatched cardinality or source comments",
    "migration recipes require exact scope preconditions typed steps constraints postconditions and validation and never execute edits",
    "static impact preserves direct relations and reason paths and never claims runtime breakage severity safety performance or fixability",
    "wow-graph retains direct dependencies only on wow-core and wow-store and never calls project reference search or service",
    "lineage publication is immutable complete partitioned exact-generation and independently read-back validated",
    "no raw SQL source execution filesystem network process editor client model embedding or unbounded graph/pair surface",
    "missing implementation corpus benchmark runtime evidence or checksum is blocking or NotEvaluated and never pass",
    "no Cargo Rust source or CI is added during the documentation phase"
  ],
